<title>CHINA: Angang New Steel debuts at HK$2.00/shr.</title>
<headline>Angang New Steel debuts at HK$2.00/shr.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Chinese steel producer Angang New Steel Co Ltd debuted at HK$2.00 per share, compared with their issue price of HK$1.63 each.</p>
</text>
